 Report←{
⍝ ⍺: test names
⍝ ⍵: test results
     r←⍪⊂'Results of ',(⍕≢⍺),' test functions.'
     code←⊃¨⍵
     passed←+/1=code
     failed←+/0=code
     error←+/¯1=code
     bad←0≥code
     r⍪←⍪(∨/bad)/⊂'Failures: '
     bad_fns←2⊃¨⍣(0<+/bad)⊢bad/⍵
     err←⍸bad/error
     r⍪←⊂⍪'*'∘,¨@err⊢bad_fns
     r⍪←(0<passed)/⊂(⍕passed),' tests passed'
     r⍪←⊂(0<failed)/(⍕failed),' tests failed'
     r⍪←⊂(0<error)/(⍕error),' tests errored (indicated with asterisks * above)'
     ⍕r
 }
